<title>UK: EUROTUNNEL H1 TURNOVER DROPS AFTER FIRE.</title>
<headline>EUROTUNNEL H1 TURNOVER DROPS AFTER FIRE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel said on Wednesday its first half turnover fell to 168.8 million stg from 223.6 million stg in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
